  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); padding: 10px; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6000003814697px; font-size: 11pt;\"><b>&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;</b>의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 <b><span style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">'협업'</span></b>을 위해<b> 공유</b>되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><u>수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</u></span></b></span></font></p><p style=\"line-height: 19.2000007629395px; text-align: center;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; line-height: 1.6;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br></p><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"border-style: dashed; border-width: 3px; border-color: rgb(121, 165, 228); background-color: rgb(219, 232, 251); padding: 10px;\"><p><b style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">#빛 #구글문서 #가상실험</span></b></p></div><p><br></p></div><p>안녕하세요 과학쌤^^</p><p>빛 관련 디딤영상과 구글문서 활동지를 공유합니다.</p><p>주로 가상실험이나 가정에서 할 수 있는 실험&nbsp;위주로 짜서 원격 수업에 활용했습니다.</p><p><b>(김정식 선생님 과학사랑, 이동준 선생님 자바실험실, 김지향 선생님 실험)</b></p><p><br></p><p>1. 물체를 보는 과정</p><p>[구글문서]&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WxomQ5IP20te8FYQzimqS3brp9GIixNx/copy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WxomQ5IP20te8FYQzimqS3brp9GIixNx/copy</a></p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WxomQ5IP20te8FYQzimqS3brp9GIixNx/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1WxomQ5IP20te8FYQzimqS3brp9GIixNx/view?usp=sharing</a><br></p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UvL_Yv4vPDM\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p>2. 빛의 합성</p><p>[구글문서]&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/19gJOArdeMr-qDe3U9Z_HQElJei-17Ys6/copy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/19gJOArdeMr-qDe3U9Z_HQElJei-17Ys6/copy</a></p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/19gJOArdeMr-qDe3U9Z_HQElJei-17Ys6/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/19gJOArdeMr-qDe3U9Z_HQElJei-17Ys6/view?usp=sharing</a><br></p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F_f-Wr1rNNo\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p>3. 물체의 색</p><p>[구글문서]&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cYMlsth5r523CQn4B7C9dIijw_TloeEm/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cYMlsth5r523CQn4B7C9dIijw_TloeEm/view?usp=sharing</a></p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cYMlsth5r523CQn4B7C9dIijw_TloeEm/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1cYMlsth5r523CQn4B7C9dIijw_TloeEm/view?usp=sharing</a><br></p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/KQ4boAjSCis\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p>4. 빛의 반사</p><p>[구글문서]&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BM6rg-NySsqODITqSbJI_tc2OX_P5gQ_/copy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BM6rg-NySsqODITqSbJI_tc2OX_P5gQ_/copy</a></p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BM6rg-NySsqODITqSbJI_tc2OX_P5gQ_/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1BM6rg-NySsqODITqSbJI_tc2OX_P5gQ_/view?usp=sharing</a><br></p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ik9wTzsTsfA\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p>5. 볼록거울 오목거울</p><p>[구글문서]&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/12JDrf4URYVaGEizQZy2IMUHJhBmcqmMG/copy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/12JDrf4URYVaGEizQZy2IMUHJhBmcqmMG/copy</a></p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/12JDrf4URYVaGEizQZy2IMUHJhBmcqmMG/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/12JDrf4URYVaGEizQZy2IMUHJhBmcqmMG/view?usp=sharing</a><br></p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QJgy-PMVcNw\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p>6. 빛의 굴절</p><p>[구글문서]&nbsp;<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1OfvfvJxdxref9eojT6Gk__mJ-qapqVzv/copy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1OfvfvJxdxref9eojT6Gk__mJ-qapqVzv/copy</a></p><p><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1OfvfvJxdxref9eojT6Gk__mJ-qapqVzv/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"tx-link\">https://drive.google.com/file/d/1OfvfvJxdxref9eojT6Gk__mJ-qapqVzv/view?usp=sharing</a><br></p><p><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HKLy-NiiNCQ\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
